payload.longDescriptionOriginal:
Docteur Bet brings football statistics into ChatGPT. Ask about a match, a title race or a team's form, and get probabilities computed by a published Dixon-Coles model (Dixon & Coles, 1997), recalculated after every round, for 21 competitions: the Premier League, LaLiga, Serie A, Bundesliga and Ligue 1, three second divisions, other European leagues, the Champions League and the Europa League.

What you can ask:
• a match's chances: home win, draw, away win, number of goals, both teams scoring and the most likely exact scores, with expected goals and each team's attack and defence strength;
• a league's season projection: each team's chances of winning the title, finishing in the European places or being relegated, and its projected points, from tens of thousands of simulated seasons;
• a power ranking: which teams are stronger or weaker than their league position suggests;
• upcoming fixtures of a competition with their probabilities.

Team nicknames are understood ("PSG", "Man City", "Barça"). Every answer names the model, the calculation date and links to the source page. Read-only, no account needed, no personal data.
